  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "| | Singular | Plural |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| **Cerca** | this (este/a) | these (estos/as) |",
      "| **Lejos** | that (ese/a) | those (esos/as) |",
      "",
      "**Con sustantivo:** *this jacket, these shoes, that hat, those socks.*",
      "**Solos:** *This is my bag. These are my keys.*",
      "",
      "**Concordancia:** this/that + singular · these/those + plural: *these shoes* (no *this shoes*).",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *this* /ðɪs/ (i corta) vs *these* /ðiːz/ (i larga)."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "this shoes",
        "right": "these shoes",
        "note": "Con plural se usa these."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "those is my hat",
        "right": "that is my hat",
        "note": "Singular lejano: that."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
